{"about_the_game":"The Clubies is a party platformer where players navigate cute cube characters through the disco to reach the dancefloor! Encounter various hazards, puzzles, and shortcuts in a fun, colorful environment as you master user-built levels together.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur little Cluby dreams of building the world's most fabulous club! To achieve this, he must conduct market research - which means dancing on every dancefloor across the globe to learn what makes a great club! <br />\r\nCluby doesn't want to dance alone, so he can clone himself! This creates hilarious chaos with tricky puzzles to solve and physics-based controls that reveal the craziest shortcuts. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur game is a fun party platformer, perfect for casual gamers and offering a fantastic medium for social interactions and friendly competition. Players can enjoy fascinating levels created by friends, either having a blast together in Co-op mode or competing for the best times. <br />\r\nOur user-friendly level editor allows those who want to create their own levels to bring their creative ideas to life and share them with others. All this takes place in a cheerful and colorful environment, providing hours of fun and shared experiences.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2538170?t=1759253224","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2538170?t=1759253224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759253224","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759253224","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3028670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"The Clubies is a party platformer where players navigate cute cube characters through the disco to reach the dancefloor! Encounter various hazards, puzzles, and shortcuts in a fun, colorful environment as you master user-built levels together.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur little Cluby dreams of building the world's most fabulous club! To achieve this, he must conduct market research - which means dancing on every dancefloor across the globe to learn what makes a great club! <br />\r\nCluby doesn't want to dance alone, so he can clone himself! This creates hilarious chaos with tricky puzzles to solve and physics-based controls that reveal the craziest shortcuts. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur game is a fun party platformer, perfect for casual gamers and offering a fantastic medium for social interactions and friendly competition. Players can enjoy fascinating levels created by friends, either having a blast together in Co-op mode or competing for the best times. <br />\r\nOur user-friendly level editor allows those who want to create their own levels to bring their creative ideas to life and share them with others. All this takes place in a cheerful and colorful environment, providing hours of fun and shared experiences.","developers":["Cluby Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2538170/header.jpg?t=1759253224","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.co